  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #e1edf5; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #e1edf5;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
          <table role="presentation" class="ssb-container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 600px; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px;">

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" align="center" bgcolor="#071e3f" style="background-color: #071e3f; padding: 28px 32px; border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #ffffff;">
                <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="display: inline-block; text-decoration: none;">
                  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0958/0874/9868/files/SSS-Horizontal-transparent-png.png?width=480" alt="Sapphire Shadow Studio" width="240" height="89" style="display: block; width: 240px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;">
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" style="padding: 36px 32px 8px 32px;">
                <h1 class="ssb-h1" style="margin: 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; line-height: 36px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">
                  Thank you for subscribing to Sapphire Shadow Studio!
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" style="padding: 20px 32px 8px 32px;">
                <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">
                  Maddie and Seth, a husband-and-wife team
                </h2>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  Sapphire Shadow Studio is a small custom embroidery studio, and it is the two of
                  us. We design it, we make it, we pack it. Nothing leaves here that we have not
                  looked at twice.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  Everything has to pass one test before it goes up: would we want to own it
                  ourselves? If the fabric feels cheap, it is out. If the stitching is not right, it
                  does not ship. That rule is the entire quality process, and it is stricter than it
                  sounds.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  This is not fast fashion and it is not mass produced. It is two people making
                  things worth keeping, one piece at a time, and we are genuinely excited to finally
                  show you.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" align="center" style="padding: 8px 32px 24px 32px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#071e3f" style="background-color: #071e3f; border-radius: 4px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 16px;">
                      <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3aa0e6;">How we work</p>
                      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" bgcolor="#0c2c56" style="background-color: #0c2c56; padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">Made to order</span>
                          </td>
                          <td style="width: 12px; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;">&nbsp;</td>
                          <td align="center" bgcolor="#0c2c56" style="background-color: #0c2c56; padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">Stitched in-house</span>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
