                        <span style="display: block; padding-top: 8px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">Lead II Quarter-Zip</span>
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td width="50%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding: 0 6px 18px 6px;">
                      <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/lead-ii-vest-womens" style="text-decoration: none;">
                        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0958/0874/9868/files/lead2_vest_black_rn_flat-1.jpg?width=524&amp;height=524&amp;crop=center" alt="A black microfleece vest laid flat, embroidered on the chest with a first name above the letters RN and a red heartbeat line." width="262" height="262" style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 262px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; border: 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                        <span style="display: block; padding-top: 8px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">Lead II Vest</span>
                      </a>
                    </td>
                    <td width="50%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding: 0 6px 18px 6px;">
                      <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/shift-fuel-tote" style="text-decoration: none;">
                        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0958/0874/9868/files/shift-fuel-tote_flat-1.jpg?width=524&amp;height=524&amp;crop=center" alt="A natural canvas tote bag with black handles and a black base panel, laid flat, embroidered across the front with the words powered by caffeine and trauma between an iced coffee cup and a pair of shears." width="262" height="262" style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 262px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; border: 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                        <span style="display: block; padding-top: 8px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">Shift Fuel Tote</span>
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding: 0 6px 18px 6px;">
                      <table role="presentation" width="262" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center">
                            <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/sapphire-shadow-studio-gift-card" style="text-decoration: none;">
                              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0958/0874/9868/files/SSS-Square-White-BG-png.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;crop=center" alt="The Sapphire Shadow Studio logo on a white square." width="262" height="262" style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 262px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; border: 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                              <span style="display: block; padding-top: 8px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">Gift Card</span>
                            </a>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" style="padding: 32px 32px 8px 32px;">
                <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #071e3f;">
                  What happens next
                </h2>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  Everything here is made to order. Nothing sits in a bin waiting to be picked: when
                  an order comes in, we set the design up, stitch it, and look it over before it is
                  packed. That is why it takes longer than a warehouse would, and it is the reason
                  the piece is right when it reaches you.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  Production and delivery times are on the
                  <a href="{{ shop.url }}/policies/shipping-policy" style="color: #0071C2; text-decoration: underline;">shipping policy</a>,
                  and the <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/faq" style="color: #0071C2; text-decoration: underline;">FAQ page</a> covers sizing,
                  personalisation, and returns.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333;">
                  If your question is not there, reply to this email. It reaches the two of us, not a
                  help desk.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="ssb-pad" align="center" style="padding: 20px 32px 8px 32px;">
                <table role="presentation" class="ssb-button" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#0071C2" style="border-radius: 4px;">
